Year = {2011},
Volume = {16},
Number = {10},
Pages = {99-104},
Abstract = {the cashless payments industry has dramatically changed over the past
   decades. The future will witness even more spectacular evolution, due to
   two main factors: technology and European policies. The Romanian
   cashless payments industry is currently underdeveloped and often has
   diverging and/or contradictory evolution comparing to the most of EU
   Member States. Based on the behavioral patterns and EU policies, a
   strategy regarding the development of cahless payments can be drawn out,
   as well as a way to put it into practice. Romania must generally try to
   move in the direction taken by most of the European countries, and,
   above all, at a rate that should surpass the EU average in order to
   slowly close the existing gap.},
