Title = {Blooming Digital Payment System in India and its affirmation to Indian
   Users},
Journal = {INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF EARLY CHILDHOOD SPECIAL EDUCATION},
Year = {2022},
Volume = {14},
Number = {4},
Pages = {1271-1276},
Abstract = {The digital payment topography is budding in the country at a stride.
   After the demonetization, complete turnaround retraction in the payment
   has been monitored. The technological metamorphose and government's
   manoeuvre of cashless economy, followed by demonetization has
   embellished the expansion of non-banking players in the banking
   latitude. Ewallets have made a noteworthy expanse in the Indian banking
   system, it becomes undeniable to study the customers' insight for the
   digital payments and the use of UPI. The pandemic has given a major
   nudge to the digital banking system, but the transformation of Indian
   banking from traditional banking to paperless, branchless business model
   is a sophisticated journey which offers a wider the latitude of prolific
   services and products.
   An attempt is made here by author to venture the digital payment system
   in India and check the inclination of users towards digital payment
   system. The study also brings forward perceptions about India's
   groundwork to transpose towards digital payments. The expedition of
   digital payment system from pandemic towards endemic which has been an
   overhaul for the Indian banking industry.},
